{
  "name": "sr-agent-frontend",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "sr_agent_platform 前端（Vue3+TS+Vite）· Phase 1 = 框架无关 TS 核心 + Node 像素 golden；Phase 2 = Vue3 工程骨架（路由/状态层/vendor 落地）",
